<title>FINLAND: Huhtamaki Jan-April profit rises 8.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Huhtamaki Jan-April profit rises 8.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   117 vs 108</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.10 vs 2.73</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,898 vs 2,521</p>
<p> Operating profit				   109 vs 156</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 13 analysts' forecasts for Finnish confectionery and packaging group Huhtamaki Oy's profit after financial items had been 125 million markka in a 90-160 million markka range.</p>
</text>
